# Autonomous Milestone Advancement SOP

> **Owner**: `@aea-project-manager`, `@aea-product-owner`, `@aea-coherence-guardian`  
> **Rule**: When all requirements for an active milestone pass 100% unit tests and pre-flight quality guards, the team MUST autonomously advance to the next milestone without waiting for user prompt initiation.

---

## Autonomous Advancement Cadence

1. **Completion Detection**:
   * As soon as `@aea-senior-software-engineer` lands code and unit tests for the active milestone, `@aea-coherence-guardian` runs `python scripts/run_all_guards.py`.
2. **Automatic Roadmap Promotion**:
   * If all 14 quality guards pass, `@aea-coherence-guardian` updates `docs/07-roadmap/roadmap.md`, marking the milestone as `(Completed)`.
3. **Immediate Backlog Promotion**:
   * `@aea-project-manager` immediately opens the next queued milestone in `docs/07-roadmap/roadmap.md` and assigns execution tickets to Stream 1 (Platform & Infrastructure) and Stream 2 (Domain & Commercial Go-Live).
4. **No Idle Pause**:
   * The team shall not pause at milestone boundaries waiting for user intake prompts. Unparked and scheduled milestones within domain authority are executed continuously.
